# CUDD-feature build of the SAME sources — configflux-4jmc. Identical crate
# (crate_name = "compiler") over the SAME COMPILER_LIB_SRCS, distinguished only
# by `crate_features = ["cudd"]` + the cudd_sys dep. Sources are NOT duplicated;
# `src/cudd_build/*.rs` already live in COMPILER_LIB_SRCS and compile in only
# under the feature (rules_rust permits srcs not reached by a `mod` in the lean
# build). Consumed by the CUDD construction tests and the synthetic fixture
# generator's --construction=cudd path.
